{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114132636416-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114133830\"/><p>男童被送往聯合醫院接受檢查。</p><p>觀塘發生虐兒案。今日(14日)早上8時43分，協和街33號一單位，一名7歲男童母親報案，指男童懷疑在上址被外籍家傭不恰當對待後感到鼻子痛楚。</p><p>人員接報到場，經初步調查，37歲菲律賓籍女傭懷疑曾以手掌摑男童面部。菲傭涉嫌「對所看管兒童或少年人虐待或忽略」被捕，現正被扣留調查。男童沒有表面傷痕，清醒被送往基督教聯合醫院接受檢查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:30.522628+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T05:26:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:00:31.171777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:53:57.312941+00:00","content_hash":"8fd5223e9cf75c9d5ead094fa4b94cb9b8a63971d67f066a5e2aecf2a1d63324","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T06:00:30.522628+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}